    "answer": {
      "short": "4.5 cups",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{4 parts}&=6\\text{ cups}\\\\\\text{1 part}&=6\\div4=1.5\\text{ cups}\\\\\\text{3 parts}&=1.5\\times3=4.5\\text{ cups}\\end{align*}$$\nChloe will need 4.5 cups of milk.",
